    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf19 <i>When the night grows deep and the world looks away... a Dogaby rises.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moonlit Reaper</strong> is a stage-based action RPG defense game where you become a young Dogaby, stepping into the world to punish the wicked and harvest their souls.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Collect and upgrade powerful weapons and face stronger malevolents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Cut through hordes before they run away.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf11 Roguelite: Transcend to go back in time to correct what you left behind</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf00 Isometric Hack and Slash Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in real-time combat, wielding magical and melee attacks.<br>Move with <strong>WASD</strong>, attack with precision in a dance of focus and fury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf00 Stage-Based Roguelite Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive increasingly intense waves of enemies.<br> Sometimes, a presence far beyond the usual breaches the Hollow. \u2620\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf00 Collect and Upgrade Weapons, Skills, and Strength</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover powerful weapons, equipment, and support items.<br>Forge your own combat style with upgrades, skill unlocks, and stat boosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf00 Transcendence System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon defeat or at will, transcend to return to the beginning.<br>Bring back your most treasured weapons, permanent upgrades, and precious soul shards into the next challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf00 Base Defense with Tactical Depth</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold back enemy forces and don't let them break the ring and escape.<br>Every decision matters \u2014 when to push forward, and when to fall back for a breath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf00 Face Unique Bosses and Malevolent Beings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against animals sworn to darkness, people claimed by shadow, and evil born from pure malice. Each enemy presents a distinct presence and challenge, leading to unforgettable encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf00 Emotional Narrative with Heartfelt Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet villagers who believe in you and support your journey.<br>Face enemies who may not be what they seem.<br>Every soul has a reason to fight \u2014 or a reason to regret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf00 Random Events and Encounters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend Action Points between stages to explore surprise events.<br>Make hard choices, meet mysterious strangers, and experience fleeting moments of mystery, humor, or risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf00 Village: Upgrade, Converse, and Grow</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return between battles to rest and prepare.<br>Upgrade skills, speak with unique NPCs, and explore this living, breathing world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're here for the thrill of battle, or the quiet stories in-between,<br><strong>Moonlit Reaper</strong> invites you into a world where every soul matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f If this journey speaks to you, add it to your wishlist and be ready when the harvest begins.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf19 <i>When the night grows deep and the world looks away... a Dogaby rises.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moonlit Reaper</strong> is a stage-based action RPG defense game where you become a young Dogaby, stepping into the world to punish the wicked and harvest their souls.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Collect and upgrade powerful weapons and face stronger malevolents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Cut through hordes before they run away.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf11 Roguelite: Transcend to go back in time to correct what you left behind</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf00 Isometric Hack and Slash Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in real-time combat, wielding magical and melee attacks.<br>Move with <strong>WASD</strong>, attack with precision in a dance of focus and fury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf00 Stage-Based Roguelite Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive increasingly intense waves of enemies.<br> Sometimes, a presence far beyond the usual breaches the Hollow. \u2620\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf00 Collect and Upgrade Weapons, Skills, and Strength</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover powerful weapons, equipment, and support items.<br>Forge your own combat style with upgrades, skill unlocks, and stat boosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf00 Transcendence System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon defeat or at will, transcend to return to the beginning.<br>Bring back your most treasured weapons, permanent upgrades, and precious soul shards into the next challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf00 Base Defense with Tactical Depth</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold back enemy forces and don't let them break the ring and escape.<br>Every decision matters \u2014 when to push forward, and when to fall back for a breath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf00 Face Unique Bosses and Malevolent Beings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against animals sworn to darkness, people claimed by shadow, and evil born from pure malice. Each enemy presents a distinct presence and challenge, leading to unforgettable encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf00 Emotional Narrative with Heartfelt Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet villagers who believe in you and support your journey.<br>Face enemies who may not be what they seem.<br>Every soul has a reason to fight \u2014 or a reason to regret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf00 Random Events and Encounters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend Action Points between stages to explore surprise events.<br>Make hard choices, meet mysterious strangers, and experience fleeting moments of mystery, humor, or risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf00 Village: Upgrade, Converse, and Grow</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return between battles to rest and prepare.<br>Upgrade skills, speak with unique NPCs, and explore this living, breathing world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're here for the thrill of battle, or the quiet stories in-between,<br><strong>Moonlit Reaper</strong> invites you into a world where every soul matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f If this journey speaks to you, add it to your wishlist and be ready when the harvest begins.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Where lost souls drift and silence screams, you walk alone beneath the moonlight toward shadows of pure malice. Reap those beyond redemption. Collect weapons and skills. Grow strength from each fall. In this roguelite action, you are the Moonlit Reaper \u2014 not a hero, but a promise kept in moonlight.",
